== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Stone Buttons''' can be placed as a block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} or plots in {{Zone|The Garden}}. When pressed on a {{Zone|Private Island}}, they will activate a connected {{Item|Redstone}} signal.

